H("889.d.1.A",3,"At a powerplant job fair, Lena compares working at an engine overhaul shop, a regional airline and running her own engine repair business. She is:","identifying and comparing employment opportunities, including entrepreneurship",["avoiding jobs","ignoring careers","picking randomly"],"Engine careers.")
